    "tutorial.lesson0.description": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Chinese Chess board has 9 vertical lines and 10 horizontal lines.\n\nThe \"Chu River and Han Border\" divides the board.\n\nEach side has a \"Palace\" — a 3×3 area with diagonal lines where the General moves.\n\nRed is at the bottom (rows 5-9), Black at the top (rows 0-4).\n\nPieces are placed on intersections, not in squares."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "中国象棋棋盘由 9 条竖线和 10 条横线交叉组成。\n\n中间的「楚河汉界」将棋盘分为两方。\n\n每方有一个「九宫」——由米字斜线组成的 3×3 区域，将/帅在此活动。\n\n红方在下（row 5-9），黑方在上（row 0-4）。\n\n交叉点共 90 个，棋子放在交叉点上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson0.subtitle": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Learn the board layout"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "了解棋盘的构成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson0.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Board Overview"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋盘认识"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson1.description": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "🔴 Rook: moves in straight lines\n🔴 Knight: L-shape, blocked by adjacent pieces\n🔴 Bishop: diagonal, blocked at center river\n🔴 Cannon: captures by jumping, moves straight otherwise\n🔴 Pawn: can move sideways after crossing the river\n🔴 Advisor: diagonal within the palace\n🔴 General: one step within the palace\n\nTap a piece to see valid moves!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "🔴 车走直线，可进可退\n🔴 马走日字，蹩脚不能跳\n🔴 象走田字，塞眼不能过\n🔴 炮翻山吃子，不吃子走直线\n🔴 兵卒过河可横移，不退\n🔴 士走斜线，不出九宫\n🔴 将帅不出宫，横竖一步\n\n点击棋子查看可走位置！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson1.subtitle": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Learn how each piece moves"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "学习每种棋子的移动规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson1.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Piece Movements"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "棋子走法"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson2.description": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⚡ Check: your General is under attack\nRespond by: flee, block, or capture\n\n🏆 Checkmate: Check with no possible response = Win\n\n⚠️ Stalemate = Loss! (No legal moves)\n\n❌ Perpetual check = Loss for the checker!\n❌ Perpetual chase = Loss for the chaser!\n\n💡 Remember: stalemate is a loss, perpetual check/chase is also a loss!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⚡ 将军：对方走子后，你的将/帅被攻击\n应将方式：逃跑、挡住、吃子\n\n🏆 将死：将军且对方无法应将 = 获胜\n\n⚠️ 困毙 = 输！（轮到走棋但无棋可走）\n\n❌ 长将判负：连续将军判将军方负\n❌ 长捉判负：连续捉子判捉子方负\n\n💡 记住：困毙是输，长将长捉也是输！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson2.subtitle": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check, checkmate, stalemate, perpetual check"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将军、将死、困毙、长将判负"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson2.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Basic Rules"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "基本规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson3.description": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Practice moving pieces!\n\nTap your piece, then tap the destination to move."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在棋盘上练习走子！\n\n点击你的棋子，再点击目标位置即可移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson3.subtitle": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move your Rook"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "移动你的车"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson3.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moving Practice"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "走子练习"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson4.description": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moving and capturing use the same action.\n\nWhen the destination has an enemy piece, move there to capture it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "走子和吃子是同一个操作。\n\n当目标格上有对方棋子时，移动过去即可吃掉它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson4.subtitle": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capture the enemy Cannon"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用车吃掉对方的炮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson4.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Capturing Practice"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "吃子练习"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson5.description": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Cannon is special: it needs exactly one \"screen\" piece between it and the target.\n\nMove your Cannon and use your own piece as a screen to check the enemy General!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "炮的攻击方式特殊：需要恰好一个「炮架」在中间才能攻击。\n\n移动你的炮，利用己方棋子作为炮架来将军对方将！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson5.subtitle": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check the enemy General with Cannon"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用炮将军对方将"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson5.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check Practice"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将军练习"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson6.description": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You must respond to check!\n\nMove your General sideways off the attacked file to escape.\n\n⚠️ You cannot ignore check!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "被将军时必须应将！\n\n将/帅横向移出被攻击的列即可脱离危险。\n\n⚠️ 不能不应将！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson6.subtitle": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You're in check — respond!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方将军，请应将"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson6.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Responding to Check"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应将练习"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson7.description": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checkmate = Check with no possible response.\n\nLook carefully: the enemy General is trapped in the palace by its own advisors.\nFind the move that delivers checkmate!\n\n💡 Hint: The Cannon can use the enemy's own piece as a screen!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将死 = 将军且对方无法应将。\n\n仔细观察：对方将被困在宫中，双士堵塞逃跑路线。\n找到一步就能将死的走法！\n\n💡 提示：炮可以用对方自己的棋子作为炮架！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson7.subtitle": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Palace Smother — Cannon Kill"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "闷宫杀 — 炮的绝杀"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson7.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checkmate in One"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一步将死"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson8.description": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before capturing, check: is it safe?\n\nThe enemy Cannon looks like a free capture, but a Rook lurks behind it.\nCapturing the Cannon leads to recapture — a losing trade!\n\nChoose a safe move and preserve your material!"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "走棋前要检查：吃子后是否安全？\n\n黑炮看似可以白吃，但后方有黑车伏击。\n吃炮会被反吃，损失更大！\n\n选择安全的走法，保留实力！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson8.subtitle": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bait and Ambush"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "诱饵与伏击"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tutorial.lesson8.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Avoid Hanging Pieces"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "避免送子"
          }
        }
      }
    },
